    "created_at": "2016-05-02T12:58:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-02T12:58:02Z",
    "body": "Since these would not have any normative requirements, I don't think this is a good idea. (That is: cloneability and transferability is already defined by the presence of the object in the StructuredClone algorithm, or by the presence of a [[Transfer]] internal method.) These annotations would easily get out of sync with the actual normative spec, and cause confusion.\n",
